{"headword":"בָּשָׂר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> flesh <strong>(</strong>cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">بَشَرٌ</span> <em>skin</em>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܶܣܪܳܐ</span>, Assyrian <em>bišru</em>, <em>blood-relation</em>, Dl <sup>Assyrian Stud. i. 143, cf. Pr 170</sup>, Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">בשר תורם</span> <em>flesh of bulls</em><strong>)</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:21\" href=\"/Genesis.2.21\">Gn 2:21</a> + 126 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּשַׂר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:11\" href=\"/Genesis.17.11\">Gn 17:11</a> + 40 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּשָׂרִי</span> etc. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:9\" href=\"/Psalms.16.9\">ψ 16:9</a> + 96 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּשָׂרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.30\">Pr 14:30</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>of the body:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>of animals</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:2-19\" href=\"/Genesis.41.2-19\">Gn 41:2–19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:28\" href=\"/Exodus.21.28\">Ex 21:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:30\" href=\"/Exodus.22.30\">22:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:12\" href=\"/Numbers.12.12\">Nu 12:12</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:4-33\" href=\"/Numbers.11.4-33\">Nu 11:4–33</a> (JE) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:4\" href=\"/Genesis.9.4\">Gn 9:4</a> + (P 30 times) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.15\">Dt 12:15</a> + (D 9 times) <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:19-21\" href=\"/Judges.6.19-21\">Ju 6:19–21</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.13\">1 S 2:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.6\">1 K 17:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.21\">19:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 31:31\" href=\"/Job.31.31\">Jb 31:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 41:15\" href=\"/Job.41.15\">41:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:13\" href=\"/Psalms.50.13\">ψ 50:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:20\" h